  <!-- No post-build copy into Becky!'s PlugIns folder. It lives under
       Program Files, so the copy needs elevation that a build never has,
       and the step failed with MSB3021 on every build - noise that would
       have hidden a real warning. Deployment is a separate, elevated step
       (stop B2.exe, copy, restart), which is what it has to be anyway: the
       DLL cannot be replaced while Becky! has it loaded. -->
